{{Documentation/Header}}
Notice template for linking to CSS pages.

==Syntax==
{{T|CSS|v1=first page|v2=second page (optional)}}

==Examples==
{{T|CSS|p1=Gadget-citizen-base|p2=Gadget-citizen-vars|_Y_=1}}

==Template Data==
